Fish: access to the loot tables for the changes of mods (P9.3).

horizon-items keeps every loot table in the private `Items::loot`. This patch adds
`Items::fish_loot_tables`, which `fish_lib::content_items` (called after the item table is read,
patch 0009) uses to apply the loot table changes mods registered (`fish:loot`) through
`fish_loader::tables::apply_loot`: replacements first, then the added pools.
